    "body": "This would turn off 4chan X on the HTTP version of 4chan to prevent leaking posting and browsing history to a MITM, and for convenience redirect to HTTPS 4chan. Could be combined with the inverse of `Exempt Archives from Encryption` to cut down 4chan X's ever-expanding number of settings. Would be off by default, but at the top of the settings so it's easy to notice.\n\nDescription could be \"For increased privacy, use only the HTTPS version of 4chan and the archives.\"\n",
